## LOINC

Files carrying real LOINC codes: resources/order-profiles.edn (the
CBC and BMP lab-panel codes and their component analytes,
notes/facts-register.md F7), test/ehrt/sim/fixtures/fixture-clinic.json
(one Body-temperature observation code, F11), and generated demo
output under docs/demos/ that renders these same codes (no new LOINC
content of its own). Every LOINC code this project embeds carries its
own display name alongside it (the `:display` field on each concept
triplet, docs/sim-theory.md's code-provenance law) -- the pairing
LOINC's own license requires when a LOINC identifier is extracted from
the Licensed Materials. No LOINC Table, Panels and Forms File, Answer
File, or other bulk LOINC artifact is redistributed anywhere in this
project; only these small, individually-verified codes, each with its
own facts-register row and last-verified date.

Per LOINC's Copyright Notice and License
(https://loinc.org/license/, fetched verbatim 2026-07-27,
