## SNOMED CT

This project never redistributes bulk SNOMED CT content (no SNOMED CT
table, release file, or browser export ships anywhere in this repo).
Every SNOMED CT code this project's data carries reaches it by one of
two narrower paths, each already tracked on its own terms: codes
embedded in the vendored Synthea module (resources/modules/sinusitis.json)
ride that file's own Apache-2.0 distribution from Synthea
(notes/facts-register.md F2, resources/modules/NOTICE) -- Synthea's own
license, not a separate SNOMED grant, is what covers their presence
here; codes in this project's own hand-authored test fixture
(test/ehrt/sim/fixtures/fixture-clinic.json) were individually
looked up and verified against a primary or search-engine-mediated
source at authoring time (notes/facts-register.md F10, three codes) and
are used, as small individually-verified identifiers rather than bulk
content, under the terms available to US NLM/UMLS users
(notes/facts-register.md F4). Neither path constitutes redistribution
of the SNOMED CT release itself, and this project's own code-provenance
law (docs/sim-theory.md) forbids inventing a code that wasn't verified
this way.
